          "evidence": "Authored module notes: Captures Modo per-version preference files (modoNN.CFG), kit installations, and saved UI layouts from %LOCALAPPDATA%\\Luxology. No winget ID — Modo installs via the Foundry Hub or direct installer. Disk/GL caches, crash dumps, temp files, undo history, autosaves, and thumbnail caches excluded. License blobs marked warn-only in secrets. Confidence: medium — folder confirmed by community sources and Foundry documentation; exact sub-paths vary by Modo version. Authored secret warning: Modo license binding is handled by the Foundry Licensing Service (FLS), not files under %LOCALAPPDATA%\\Luxology. Any local .lic or license blob is machine-/account-specific and must NOT be auto-restored. Authored excluded secret or machine-bound paths: %LOCALAPPDATA%\\Luxology\\*.lic, %LOCALAPPDATA%\\Luxology\\license\\**, %LOCALAPPDATA%\\Luxology\\**\\*.lic"
